="01:26.849">We </span><span begin="01:26.849" end="01:27.304">went </span><span begin="01:27.304" end="01:28.625">miles </span><span begin="01:28.625" end="01:28.833">to </span><span begin="01:28.833" end="01:29.009">get </span><span begin="01:29.009" end="01:29.172">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.091" end="01:32.177"><span begin="01:30.091" end="01:30.290">But </span><span begin="01:30.290" end="01:30.849">wherever </span><span begin="01:30.849" end="01:31.188">we </span><span begin="01:31.188" end="01:31.585">would </span><span begin="01:31.585" end="01:32.177">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.531" end="01:35.184"><span begin="01:32.531" end="01:32.737">I </span><span begin="01:32.737" end="01:33.121">couldn't </span><span begin="01:33.121" end="01:33.707">force </span><span begin="01:33.707" end="01:33.881">the </span><span begin="01:33.881" end="01:34.409">thing </span><span begin="01:34.409" end="01:34.736">you </span><span begin="01:34.736" end="01:35.184">hold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.608" end="01:38.352"><span begin="01:35.608" end="01:35.784">I </span><span begin="01:35.784" end="01:36.337">can't </span><span begin="01:36.337" end="01:37.848">fall </span><span begin="01:37.848" end="01:38.016">with </span><span begin="01:38.016" end="01:38.352">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.672" end="01:41.313"><span begin="01:38.672" end="01:38.825">But </span><span begin="01:38.825" end="01:39.329">I'll </span><span begin="01:39.329" end="01:40.824">fall </span><span begin="01:40.824" end="01:41.002">with </span><span begin="01:41.002" end="01:41.313">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.065" end="01:44.463"><span begin="01:42.065" end="01:42.368">Right </span><span begin="01:42.368" end="01:42.665">down </span><span begin="01:42.665" end="01:43.033">to </span><span begin="01:43.033" end="01:43.257">this </span><span begin="01:43.257" end="01:43.818">old </span><span begin="01:43.818" end="01:44.463">floor</s